{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45070","headline":"奉和颜使君真卿修韵海毕会诸文士东堂重校 · 皎然","name":"奉和颜使君真卿修韵海毕会诸文士东堂重校","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"外学宗硕儒，游焉从後进。\n恃以仁恕广，不学门栏峻。\n着书裨理化，奉上表诚信。\n探讨始河图，纷纶归海韵。\n亲承大匠琢，况覩颓波振。\n错简记铅椠，阅书移玉镇。\n曷繇旌不朽，盛美流歌引。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45070.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45070","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}